title: The Reichsdruckerei
subtitle: Without the money presses there is no money to pay anyone.
view-if: crisis_cuno = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
if (!RG.e22) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.e22_lib.onArrival); }
RG.e22.cunoTick(Q.crisis_time + 1);
!}
frequency: 100
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: crisis

= The Reichsdruckerei

[? if e23_cuno_presses = 1 : The printers of the Reichsdruckerei are still out, and so are the private firms that print notes on contract. The government cannot pay its officials or its police, and the banks are rationing cash. Nor can anyone pay the strikers. ?][? if e23_cuno_presses = 0 : One press in the Reichsdruckerei is running under the eyes of the strike committee, and the notes go to the strike kitchens. The ministries have found a way to collect some of them too. ?]

- @stop: Keep every press stopped.
- @one: Let one press run, for the strike pay.
- @stopagain: Stop the last press.
- @lorry: Take a lorry of new notes for the strike fund.

@stop
subtitle: Cuno is starved of money. So are the strikers.
view-if: e23_cuno_presses = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.e23_cuno_pressure += 8;
Q.e23_cuno_endurance -= 4;
RG.district('berlin', {repression: 3});
RG.e22.cunoLines();
!}

The printers and the hundreds stand outside the Reichsdruckerei in shifts. A police charge on the second night is driven off with cobblestones.

@one
subtitle: The strikers can eat. The government will find a way to print as well.
view-if: e23_cuno_presses = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.e23_cuno_presses = 0;
Q.e23_cuno_endurance += 15;
RG.e22.cunoLines();
!}

The strike committee lets one press run at night. By morning there are sacks of new notes for the kitchens.

@stopagain
subtitle: The pressure on Cuno returns, and the kitchens go short.
view-if: e23_cuno_presses = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.e23_cuno_presses = 1;
Q.e23_cuno_pressure += 4;
RG.e22.cunoLines();
!}

The printers vote to stop the last press. The overseer is escorted out of the building with his keys.

@lorry
subtitle: One fund for the party, and the papers call it robbery.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources += 1;
Q.e23_cuno_endurance += 5;
Q.spd_relation -= 5;
RG.district('berlin', {repression: 5});
RG.e22.cunoLines();
!}

A Reichsdruckerei lorry is stopped in Kreuzberg. The notes are worth a fortune at breakfast and much less by supper.
